From bf9d63a500e097ff18c124e3b2ed50b093c6da53 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amir <gilaniamirhossein@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:45:09 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] windows: add windows-direct-tun feature to rvpn-mobile

- New cargo feature windows-direct-tun: rustls TLS backend (same as iOS
  production), dns, and the direct-TUN host-agnostic engine modules.
- Gate Apple-only code (libmalloc zone APIs, Mach task_info RSS reader)
  behind target_vendor = "apple" with no-op stubs elsewhere.
- Expose start_dns_proxy_for_direct_tun as pub so host apps (Windows
  client) can start the loopback DoH DNS proxy natively in-process.
- Windows target keeps rvpn-split-tunnel builtin data (bypass countries),
  same as macOS/Android.
